# THE AMPERSAND RULE BY POSITION (searched final programs unless the row says otherwise)
(i) final, searched                            /^\d+$/  (no &: the subject's ends)                                      on 'x300 12'  pcre2: no match
(i) final, searched                            /^\d+$/ & <256                                                           on 'x300 12'  pcre2: match (1,3) [ends at 1 qualifying: 3,2]
(i) final, searched                            /\d+/ & <256  (the same answer: the anchors add nothing)                 on 'x300 12'  pcre2: match (1,3) [ends at 1 qualifying: 3,2]
(i) look-alike P vs P & /(?s).*/               /^foo/                                                                   on 'xfoo'     pcre2: no match
(i) look-alike P vs P & /(?s).*/               /^foo/ & /(?s).*/                                                        on 'xfoo'     pcre2: match (1,4)
(i) look-alike P vs P & /(?s).*/               /foo$/                                                                   on 'foox'     pcre2: no match
(i) look-alike P vs P & /(?s).*/               /foo$/ & /(?s).*/                                                        on 'foox'     pcre2: match (0,3)
(ii) final under anchored                      anchored(/^\d+$/ & <256) = /\A${...}\z/                                  on 'x300 12'  pcre2: no match
(ii) final under anchored                      anchored(/^\d+$/ & <256)                                                 on '200'      pcre2: match (0,3)
(ii) final under anchored                      anchored(/^\d+$/ & <256)                                                 on '200\n'    pcre2: no match
(ii) final under anchored                      anchored(/\d+/ & <256)  (same answers without the operand anchors)       on '200\n'    pcre2: no match
(iii) & in a hole                              /port=${ /^\d+$/ & <256 }/                                               on 'port=80'  pcre2: match (0,7) [ends at 0 qualifying: 7,6]
(iii) & in a hole                              /port=${ /^\d+$/ & <256 }/                                               on 'port=300' pcre2: match (0,7) [ends at 0 qualifying: 7,6]
(iii) & in a hole                              /port=${ /\d+/ & <256 }\b/  (author's fix for 'the whole number')        on 'port=300' pcre2: no match
(iii) the owner's acceptance row (CF:1078-1079 on main) /999${ /\d+/ & <100 }999/                                                on '99945999' pcre2: match (0,8)
(iii) its near row                             /999${ /\d+/ & <100 }999/                                                on '99912345999' pcre2: no match
(iii) alt. reading: anchors read the SUBJECT   /port=${/^\d+$/}/ spliced (= /port=^\d+$/)                               on 'port=80'  pcre2: no match
(iii) hole look-alike, no &                    /x${/^a/}/  (a hole opens no scope: ^ = the subject's start)             on 'xa'       pcre2: no match
(iii) hole look-alike, with &                  /x${/^a/ & /(?s).*/}/                                                    on 'xa'       pcre2: match (0,2)
(iv) & nested in a hole of an & operand        /\w+/ & /a${ /^\d$/ & <5 }b/                                             on 'a3b'      pcre2: match (0,3)
(iv) alt. reading: inner ^ reads the OUTER operand's span /\w+/ & /a^\d$b/                                                         on 'a3b'      pcre2: no match
(iv) condition inside a hole                   P := /(?<w>\w)-(?<v>\w+)/; /k=${ P & (v: /^a\w*/) }/                     on 'k=x-ab'   pcre2: match (0,6) [ends at 0 qualifying: 6,5]
(iv) condition inside a hole                   P := /(?<w>\w)-(?<v>\w+)/; /k=${ P & (v: /^a\w*/) }/                     on 'k=x-ba'   pcre2: no match
(v) label: condition                           P := /(?<w>\w) (?<x>\w+)/; P & (x: /^S\w*/)                              on 'a Sab'    pcre2: match (0,5) [ends at 0 qualifying: 5,4,3]
(v) label: condition                           P & (x: /^S\w*/)                                                         on 'a xSab'   pcre2: no match
(vi) operand is an & chain                     (/^\d+/ & /\d+$/) & <256                                                 on 'x300 12'  pcre2: match (1,3) [ends at 1 qualifying: 3,2]
(vi) operand is an & chain                     /^\d+/ & (/\d+$/ & <256)                                                 on 'x300 12'  pcre2: match (1,3) [ends at 1 qualifying: 3,2]
(vii) edge assertion: why it is an ERROR       /\w+/ & /\bfoo/ read as plain PCRE on the span                           on 'xfoo'     pcre2: match (1,4)
(vii) edge assertion: the pasted text          /\w*\bfoo/  (\b reads the real context)                                  on 'xfoo'     pcre2: no match
(vii) (?m) in an operand                       /\w+/ & /(?m)^foo/                                                       on 'xfoo'     pcre2: match (1,4)
(viii) rx-text & (switch ON)                   /^\d+&${<256}$/  (operands ^\d+ and ${<256}$)                            on 'x300 12'  pcre2: match (1,3) [ends at 1 qualifying: 3,2]
(viii) rx-text & (switch ON)                   /^(?:\d+&${<256})$/  (anchors outside the group read the subject)        on 'x300 12'  pcre2: no match
(viii) rx-text & (switch ON)                   /^(?:\d+&${<256})$/                                                      on '200'      pcre2: match (0,3)
(viii) rx-text & (switch ON)                   /a|^b&\w+/  (| outside: ^b is an & operand)                              on 'xb'       pcre2: match (1,2)

# anchored(P): the ruled text \A(?:P)\z vs two readings of 'P in filter role on the enclosing scope':
#   scope = P whole on the innermost scoped match; where-it-stands = P whole on the span it takes
a final pattern                                          on 'foo\n' \A..\z: no match     | scope: no match     SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,3)  DIFF
a final pattern                                          on 'foo'   \A..\z: match (0,3)  | scope: match (0,3)  SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,3)  SAME
a final pattern, $ in P                                  on 'foo\n' \A..\z: no match     | scope: no match     SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,3)  DIFF
a final pattern, alternation at P's top                  on 'ab'    \A..\z: no match     | scope: no match     SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,1)  DIFF
a final pattern, alternation at P's top                  on 'ab'    \A..\z: match (0,2)  | scope: match (0,2)  SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,2) [ends at 0 qualifying: 2,1] DIFF
a final pattern, (?m) inside P                           on 'a\n'   \A..\z: no match     | scope: no match     SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,1)  DIFF
a final pattern, (?m) inside P                           on 'a\nb'  \A..\z: match (0,3)  | scope: match (0,3)  SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,3)  SAME
inside a filter: x & anchored(P), x := /\w+/             on 'xfoo'  \A..\z: match (1,4)  | scope: match (1,4)  SAME | where-it-stands: match (1,4)  SAME
inside a filter, (?m) and alternation                    on 'a\n'   \A..\z: match (0,1)  | scope: match (0,1)  SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,1)  SAME
a label: condition                                       on 'z ab'  \A..\z: match (0,4)  | scope: match (0,4)  SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,4)  SAME
in a HOLE: /x${anchored(/a/)}/                           on 'xa'    \A..\z: no match     | scope: no match     SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,2)  DIFF
in a HOLE at the scope's start: /${anchored(/a/)}b/      on 'ab'    \A..\z: no match     | scope: no match     SAME | where-it-stands: match (0,2)  DIFF
